{"5083440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BRUTAL DERBY", "steam_appid": 5083440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced arcade racing game where speed alone is not enough. Race through stadium tracks, avoid danger, collect power-ups, and fight for first place in intense races and demolition derby events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Super Nitro at the right moment, fire rockets at your rivals, keep them under pressure with a machine gun or laser. Every impact counts: detailed damage and deformation physics leave visible marks on your vehicle, so the damage you take stays with you until the race is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between events, upgrade and customize your vehicle in the garage, then prepare for the next challenge.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, spectacular arcade racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stadium tracks and collision-focused derby arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed damage and deformation physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons: rockets, machine guns, and lasers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups: Super Nitro and other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle upgrades and visual customization in the garage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression through stages and leaderboard challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the track, outsmart your rivals, and conquer the arena.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced arcade racing game where speed alone is not enough. Race through stadium tracks, avoid danger, collect power-ups, and fight for first place in intense races and demolition derby events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Super Nitro at the right moment, fire rockets at your rivals, keep them under pressure with a machine gun or laser. Every impact counts: detailed damage and deformation physics leave visible marks on your vehicle, so the damage you take stays with you until the race is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between events, upgrade and customize your vehicle in the garage, then prepare for the next challenge.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, spectacular arcade racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stadium tracks and collision-focused derby arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed damage and deformation physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons: rockets, machine guns, and lasers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups: Super Nitro and other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle upgrades and visual customization in the garage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression through stages and leaderboard challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the track, outsmart your rivals, and conquer the arena.</p>", "short_description": "Race across tracks and derby arenas, battling rivals with rockets, machine guns, and lasers! Fast-paced arcade racing meets spectacular crashes and detailed vehicle damage and deformation physics.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5083440/2cfc3b5a8e8d23abd5064fef4ae20421fa7a35cb/header.jpg?t=1788326664", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5083440/dfd3e1e99a2d3670f11a02e30db60c548b4381bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788326664", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5083440/dfd3e1e99a2d3670f11a02e30db60c548b4381bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788326664", "website": "https://kozari.eu", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5